        class="absolute inset-0 top-[-1lh] -z-10 h-full w-60 rotate-12 content-around place-self-center rounded-full bg-emerald-700 blur-2xl select-none"
      >
      </div> Deer!
      <p
        class="z-10 mt-8 text-center text-xl/8 font-light tracking-tight text-pretty text-mist-300"
      >
        Developer, Close-Up Magician, Science Communicator, Classical Pianist.
      </p>
    </h1>
  </div>

  <div class="relative bg-emerald-950">
    <div
      class="absolute inset-0 bg-radial from-transparent from-90% to-emerald-800 bg-size-[10px_10px] bg-fixed"
